1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,640
Food stamps are being cut, but here's how we're going to feed our communities anyway.

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:08,960
Three easy steps. This is what I've learned after feeding over 600 people in six months

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:15,140
with my mutual aid group, Mutual Rise. Step one, start a nonprofit or start collaborating with one.

4
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:20,300
This is a very important distinction. The mission for the nonprofit must be to freely feed your

5
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:26,540
neighbors who are experiencing food insecurity. Step two, use the nonprofit to contact food

6
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:32,200
businesses so you can start getting food donations. You can do this in person, via email, or on the

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:38,640
phone. I'm talking restaurants, grocery stores, bakeries, food trucks, convenience stores, local

8
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:46,280
farms, anywhere that sells food. Why does this work? Because all of these businesses produce some level

9
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:53,120
of food waste or food overflow. This just means perfectly good food that does not get eaten or

10
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:57,920
sold for whatever reason. So instead of the businesses throwing the food away and experiencing

11
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:05,060
that loss, you can provide them your nonprofit EIN and they can donate the food to you and get a tax

12
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:11,160
write-off. It's a win-win situation. Some businesses don't even care about the tax write-off. They just

13
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:16,840
want to get the wasted food off of their hands so they can get in new product and go through the entire

14
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:23,340
supply chain again of selling. Step three, once you have an agreement, pick up the food, inspect the

15
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:28,700
quality, and start freely distributing it to the families and individuals in your community who

16
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:33,600
really need it right now. It really is that straightforward. Always remember, we live in a

17
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:43,520
world full of abundance and scarcity is what? Manufactured. We are not powerless. Go out, empower yourself

18
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:51,460
and your community and get the food that's available right now. No one needs to go hungry and all food

19
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:57,660
should be free. So good luck. Get out there and let me know if you have any questions. Bye.

